      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "One other suggestion: there's some rigging advice for physbones already but it's not really centralized, and some good suggestions about rotation, how many bones to use for various things, etc, would be good. It's not as important as the IK/FBT rigging advice, but anything that avoids having to ask repetitive advice would be handy.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
